### ============================================================
### CREATE JOURNAL ENTRY
### ============================================================


### Create - valid entry
POST {{baseUrl}}/journal
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-08-15",
  "generalMood": 4,
  "energyLevel": 4,
  "sleepQuality": 3,
  "stressLevel": 2,
  "activityIds": [],
  "keyEvents": "Had a productive day working on the project.",
  "dailyGratitude": "Grateful for making good progress today."
}


