### Create - nonexistent activity
POST {{baseUrl}}/journal
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-08-15",
  "generalMood": 4,
  "energyLevel": 4,
  "sleepQuality": 3,
  "stressLevel": 2,
  "activityIds": ["00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"],
