}


### Create - duplicate date
POST {{baseUrl}}/journal
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-08-15",
  "generalMood": 5,
  "energyLevel": 5,
  "sleepQuality": 5,
  "stressLevel": 1,
  "activityIds": [],
